A drop of a field the source admits through its ... but does not declare.
A lens reads and drops only what its source declares; the forward lens of
open-source-added-optional already produces no b (#159).
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	a!: string
	...
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	a!: string
	b?: bool
	...
}

ForwardLens: (prev): {
	self: {
		b: _drop
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	a!: string
	b?: bool
	...
}
-- out/error --
error[E0340]: v0.0 does not declare b, so there is nothing to drop
 --> history/1.0.thema:9:3
  |
9 |         b: _drop
  |         ^
  |
